SUMMARY:Monthly Honky Tonk Night w/ Danny & the Do-Overs!
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the West Art Honky Tonk: an evening of free-wheelin'
  top-shelf honky-tonk at West Art! Danny Mulligan and The Do-Overs want to
  see YOU on the dance floor. Drawing on classic honky tonk sounds as their
  foundation\, they've got plenty of original music\, with a few inspired c
 overs sprinkled in for good measure. Come ready- this music is best enjoye
 d with scootin' boots! Grab a friend\, pick up your dancing shoes\, and we
 'll see ya there! Note: Join us at 6:45 for a pre-show dance lesson! Music
  is at 7:30! What to expect at the show: >> Doors will open at 6:45 for th
 e dance lesson. The music will start at 7:30. >> Tickets are $15 in advanc
 e and at the door! As always\, we’re proud to present an all-ages event!
  Come hang! >> Parking is available on the street around F&M College. We s
 uggest finding a spot on the park side of Buchanan Ave\, Race Ave\, or Col
 lege Ave (North of Buchanan). Thank you for helping us be good neighbors! 
 >> Format: This show will be mostly standing\, with plenty of room availab
 le for dancing. There are some seats available as needed. Our space is ADA
  accessible\, and we will do our best to accommodate any specific needs. >
 >The Art Bar is open daily from 7 am to 10 pm with a full espresso menu\, 
 beer\, wine\, cocktails\, N/A drinks\, and tasty bites from local bakeries
 . Come settle in before the show\, and linger after for a nightcap! >> Ple
 ase note that all ticket sales are final. Tickets purchased using digital 
 payment methods include a small service fee. Cash purchases at the door ar
 e not subject to this fee. Thank you for supporting great music!\n\nPrice:
